connect to websocket "ws://127.0.0.1:18765/a" and call it first
on open of first
    close websocket first with code 1001 and reason "going away"
.
on close of first
    say "first closed:" close code close reason close was clean state of first
.
connect to websocket "ws://127.0.0.1:18765/b" and call it second
on open of second
    close websocket second
.
on close of second
    say "second closed:" close code close reason close was clean
.
connect to websocket "ws://127.0.0.1:18765/c" and call it third
on open of third
    try
        close websocket third with code 30000000000
    otherwise into reason
        say "third:" reason
    .
    close websocket third with code 1005
    say "third state:" state of third
.
on close of third
    say "never"
.
